{"schemaVersion":2,"bookId":"bishop-pattern-recognition-2006","title":"数学记号","sourcePdfPages":[11,12],"toc":[{"number":"","title":"数学记号","block":"p01-b001","level":1}],"images":[],"blocks":[{"id":"p01-b001","page":1,"pdfPage":11,"kind":"heading","level":1,"text":"数学记号"},{"id":"p01-b002","page":1,"pdfPage":11,"kind":"paragraph","text":"我力求将本书中的数学内容控制在正确理解这一领域所必需的最低限度。不过，这个最低限度并不是零；需要强调的是，要清楚理解现代模式识别与机器学习技术，必须扎实掌握微积分、线性代数和概率论。尽管如此，本书着重传达的是方法背后的概念，而不是数学上的严格性。","segments":["我力求将本书中的数学内容控制在正确理解这一领域所必需的最低限度。不过，这个最低限度并不是零；需要强调的是，要清楚理解现代模式识别与机器学习技术，必须扎实掌握微积分、线性代数和概率论。尽管如此，本书着重传达的是方法背后的概念，而不是数学上的严格性。"]},{"id":"p01-b003","page":1,"pdfPage":11,"kind":"paragraph","text":"我尽量在全书使用一致的记号，虽然这有时意味着需要偏离相关研究文献中的某些惯例。向量用小写粗体罗马字母表示，如 $\\mathbf{x}$；所有向量都默认为列向量。上标 $\\mathrm{T}$ 表示矩阵或向量的转置，因此 $\\mathbf{x}^{\\mathrm{T}}$ 是一个行向量。大写粗体罗马字母，如 $\\mathbf{M}$，表示矩阵。记号 $(w_1,\\ldots,w_M)$ 表示包含 $M$ 个元素的行向量，相应的列向量写为 $\\mathbf{w}=(w_1,\\ldots,w_M)^{\\mathrm{T}}$。","segments":["我尽量在全书使用一致的记号，虽然这有时意味着需要偏离相关研究文献中的某些惯例。向量用小写粗体罗马字母表示，如 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{x}","text":"\\mathbf{x}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi></mrow></math>"},"；所有向量都默认为列向量。上标 ",{"tex":"\\mathrm{T}","text":"\\mathrm{T}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></math>"}," 表示矩阵或向量的转置，因此 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{x}^{\\mathrm{T}}","text":"\\mathbf{x}^{\\mathrm{T}}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup></mrow></math>"}," 是一个行向量。大写粗体罗马字母，如 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{M}","text":"\\mathbf{M}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐌</mi></mrow></math>"},"，表示矩阵。记号 ",{"tex":"(w_1,\\ldots,w_M)","text":"(w_1,\\ldots,w_M)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 表示包含 ",{"tex":"M","text":"M","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个元素的行向量，相应的列向量写为 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{w}=(w_1,\\ldots,w_M)^{\\mathrm{T}}","text":"\\mathbf{w}=(w_1,\\ldots,w_M)^{\\mathrm{T}}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐰</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup></mrow></math>"},"。"]},{"id":"p01-b004","page":1,"pdfPage":11,"kind":"paragraph","text":"记号 $[a,b]$ 表示从 $a$ 到 $b$ 的闭区间，即包含 $a$ 和 $b$ 本身的区间；$(a,b)$ 表示相应的开区间，即不包含 $a$ 和 $b$ 的区间。同样，$[a,b)$ 表示包含 $a$、但不包含 $b$ 的区间。不过，大多数情况下，我们无须过多纠缠于区间是否包含端点这样的细节。","segments":["记号 ",{"tex":"[a,b]","text":"[a,b]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"}," 表示从 ",{"tex":"a","text":"a","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>"}," 到 ",{"tex":"b","text":"b","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的闭区间，即包含 ",{"tex":"a","text":"a","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"b","text":"b","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>"}," 本身的区间；",{"tex":"(a,b)","text":"(a,b)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 表示相应的开区间，即不包含 ",{"tex":"a","text":"a","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"b","text":"b","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的区间。同样，",{"tex":"[a,b)","text":"[a,b)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 表示包含 ",{"tex":"a","text":"a","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>"},"、但不包含 ",{"tex":"b","text":"b","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的区间。不过，大多数情况下，我们无须过多纠缠于区间是否包含端点这样的细节。"]},{"id":"p01-b005","page":1,"pdfPage":11,"kind":"paragraph","text":"$M\\times M$ 的恒等矩阵（也称单位矩阵）记为 $\\mathbf{I}_M$；当维数不会引起歧义时，简写为 $\\mathbf{I}$。其元素 $I_{ij}$ 在 $i=j$ 时等于 $1$，在 $i\\ne j$ 时等于 $0$。","segments":[{"tex":"M\\times M","text":"M\\times M","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的恒等矩阵（也称单位矩阵）记为 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{I}_M","text":"\\mathbf{I}_M","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐈</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow></math>"},"；当维数不会引起歧义时，简写为 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{I}","text":"\\mathbf{I}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐈</mi></mrow></math>"},"。其元素 ",{"tex":"I_{ij}","text":"I_{ij}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></math>"}," 在 ",{"tex":"i=j","text":"i=j","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></math>"}," 时等于 ",{"tex":"1","text":"1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>"},"，在 ",{"tex":"i\\ne j","text":"i\\ne j","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></math>"}," 时等于 ",{"tex":"0","text":"0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。"]},{"id":"p01-b006","page":1,"pdfPage":11,"kind":"paragraph","text":"泛函记为 $f[y]$，其中 $y(x)$ 是某个函数。泛函的概念将在附录 D 中讨论。","segments":["泛函记为 ",{"tex":"f[y]","text":"f[y]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"},"，其中 ",{"tex":"y(x)","text":"y(x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 是某个函数。泛函的概念将在附录 D 中讨论。"]},{"id":"p01-b007","page":1,"pdfPage":11,"kind":"paragraph","text":"记号 $g(x)=O(f(x))$ 表示：当 $x\\to\\infty$ 时，$|f(x)/g(x)|$ 有界。例如，若 $g(x)=3x^2+2$，则 $g(x)=O(x^2)$。","segments":["记号 ",{"tex":"g(x)=O(f(x))","text":"g(x)=O(f(x))","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 表示：当 ",{"tex":"x\\to\\infty","text":"x\\to\\infty","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></math>"}," 时，",{"tex":"|f(x)/g(x)|","text":"|f(x)/g(x)|","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></math>"}," 有界。例如，若 ",{"tex":"g(x)=3x^2+2","text":"g(x)=3x^2+2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>"},"，则 ",{"tex":"g(x)=O(x^2)","text":"g(x)=O(x^2)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。"]},{"id":"p01-b008","page":1,"pdfPage":11,"kind":"paragraph","text":"函数 $f(x,y)$ 关于随机变量 $x$ 的期望记为 $\\mathbb{E}_x[f(x,y)]$。如果不会混淆所平均的是哪个变量，就省去下标，例如$\\mathbb{E}[x]$。如果 $x$ 的分布以另一个变量 $z$ 为条件，相应的条件期望写为 $\\mathbb{E}_x[f(x)\\mid z]$。类似地，方差记为 $\\operatorname{var}[f(x)]$；对于向量变量，协方差写为 $\\operatorname{cov}[\\mathbf{x},\\mathbf{y}]$。我们也用 $\\operatorname{cov}[\\mathbf{x}]$ 作为 $\\operatorname{cov}[\\mathbf{x},\\mathbf{x}]$ 的简写。期望与协方差的概念将在第 1.2.2 节介绍。","segments":["函数 ",{"tex":"f(x,y)","text":"f(x,y)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 关于随机变量 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的期望记为 ",{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}_x[f(x,y)]","text":"\\mathbb{E}_x[f(x,y)]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">𝔼</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"},"。如果不会混淆所平均的是哪个变量，就省去下标，例如",{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[x]","text":"\\mathbb{E}[x]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">𝔼</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"},"。如果 ",{"tex":"x","text":"x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的分布以另一个变量 ",{"tex":"z","text":"z","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></math>"}," 为条件，相应的条件期望写为 ",{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}_x[f(x)\\mid z]","text":"\\mathbb{E}_x[f(x)\\mid z]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">𝔼</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"},"。类似地，方差记为 ",{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}[f(x)]","text":"\\operatorname{var}[f(x)]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"},"；对于向量变量，协方差写为 ",{"tex":"\\operatorname{cov}[\\mathbf{x},\\mathbf{y}]","text":"\\operatorname{cov}[\\mathbf{x},\\mathbf{y}]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐲</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"},"。我们也用 ",{"tex":"\\operatorname{cov}[\\mathbf{x}]","text":"\\operatorname{cov}[\\mathbf{x}]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"}," 作为 ",{"tex":"\\operatorname{cov}[\\mathbf{x},\\mathbf{x}]","text":"\\operatorname{cov}[\\mathbf{x},\\mathbf{x}]","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的简写。期望与协方差的概念将在第 1.2.2 节介绍。"],"continuedPdfPages":[12]},{"id":"p02-b002","page":2,"pdfPage":12,"kind":"paragraph","text":"假设我们有一个 $D$ 维向量 $\\mathbf{x}=(x_1,\\ldots,x_D)^{\\mathrm{T}}$ 的 $N$ 个观测值 $\\mathbf{x}_1,\\ldots,\\mathbf{x}_N$。可以将这些观测合并成数据矩阵 $\\mathbf{X}$，其第 $n$ 行对应行向量 $\\mathbf{x}_n^{\\mathrm{T}}$。因此，$\\mathbf{X}$ 的第 $n,i$ 个元素，对应第 $n$ 个观测 $\\mathbf{x}_n$ 的第 $i$ 个分量。对于一维变量，我们将这样的矩阵记为 $\\boldsymbol{\\mathsf{x}}$：它是一个列向量，第 $n$ 个元素为 $x_n$。注意，$\\boldsymbol{\\mathsf{x}}$ 的维数为 $N$，并使用了不同的字体，以区别于维数为 $D$ 的 $\\mathbf{x}$。","segments":["假设我们有一个 ",{"tex":"D","text":"D","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></math>"}," 维向量 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{x}=(x_1,\\ldots,x_D)^{\\mathrm{T}}","text":"\\mathbf{x}=(x_1,\\ldots,x_D)^{\\mathrm{T}}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup></mrow></math>"}," 的 ",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个观测值 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{x}_1,\\ldots,\\mathbf{x}_N","text":"\\mathbf{x}_1,\\ldots,\\mathbf{x}_N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow></math>"},"。可以将这些观测合并成数据矩阵 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{X}","text":"\\mathbf{X}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐗</mi></mrow></math>"},"，其第 ",{"tex":"n","text":"n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math>"}," 行对应行向量 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{x}_n^{\\mathrm{T}}","text":"\\mathbf{x}_n^{\\mathrm{T}}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msubsup></mrow></math>"},"。因此，",{"tex":"\\mathbf{X}","text":"\\mathbf{X}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐗</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的第 ",{"tex":"n,i","text":"n,i","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个元素，对应第 ",{"tex":"n","text":"n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个观测 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{x}_n","text":"\\mathbf{x}_n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></math>"}," 的第 ",{"tex":"i","text":"i","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个分量。对于一维变量，我们将这样的矩阵记为 ",{"tex":"\\boldsymbol{\\mathsf{x}}","text":"\\boldsymbol{\\mathsf{x}}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-sans-serif\">𝘅</mi></mrow></math>"},"：它是一个列向量，第 ",{"tex":"n","text":"n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个元素为 ",{"tex":"x_n","text":"x_n","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></math>"},"。注意，",{"tex":"\\boldsymbol{\\mathsf{x}}","text":"\\boldsymbol{\\mathsf{x}}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-sans-serif\">𝘅</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的维数为 ",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"},"，并使用了不同的字体，以区别于维数为 ",{"tex":"D","text":"D","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf{x}","text":"\\mathbf{x}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐱</mi></mrow></math>"},"。"]}],"editorialStatus":"reviewed","reviewRecord":"reviews/frontmatter-review.md","sourcePdfSha256":"4ee767e0a6b04fa05ba7e599e9dbb4637a94a4407ccedf0b4d316b1fd7c8ec64"}
